ENGINE_VERSION=15.0.0 for Linux x86 (64-bit) (May 26, 2026)
XTENSOR_VERSION={1.3.0, {2025, 12, 29}}
** DefManifold: Defining manifold CAS07Screen. 
** DefVBundle: Defining vbundle TangentCAS07Screen. 
** DefTensor: Defining symmetric metric tensor euclid[-a, -b]. 
** DefTensor: Defining antisymmetric tensor epsiloneuclid[-a, -b]. 
** DefCovD: Defining covariant derivative CAS07CD[-a]. 
** DefTensor: Defining vanishing torsion tensor TorsionCAS07CD[a, -b, -i]. 
** DefTensor: Defining symmetric Christoffel tensor ChristoffelCAS07CD[a, -b, -i]. 
** DefTensor: Defining Riemann tensor RiemannCAS07CD[-a, -b, -i, -j]. 
** DefTensor: Defining symmetric Ricci tensor RicciCAS07CD[-a, -b]. 
** DefCovD: Contractions of Riemann automatically replaced by Ricci.
** DefTensor: Defining Ricci scalar RicciScalarCAS07CD[]. 
** DefCovD: Contractions of Ricci automatically replaced by RicciScalar.
** DefTensor: Defining vanishing Einstein tensor EinsteinCAS07CD[-a, -b]. 
** DefTensor: Defining vanishing Weyl tensor WeylCAS07CD[-a, -b, -i, -j]. 
** DefTensor: Defining vanishing TFRicci tensor TFRicciCAS07CD[-a, -b]. 
** DefTensor: Defining Kretschmann scalar KretschmannCAS07CD[]. 
** DefCovD: Computing RiemannToWeylRules for dim 2
** DefCovD: Computing RicciToTFRicci for dim 2
** DefCovD: Computing RicciToEinsteinRules for dim 2
** DefTensor: Defining weight +2 density Deteuclid[].      Determinant.
** DefTensor: Defining tensor mapD[-a, -b]. 
XACT_GRAM_CONTRACTION=InputForm[mapD[-a, -j]*mapD[a, -i]]
CHECK:xact_nonzero_gram:TRUE
CHECK:gram_quadratic_form:TRUE
CHECK:gram_determinant:TRUE
CHECK:cauchy_lagrange_identity:TRUE
CHECK:norm_expansion:TRUE
SCALAR_UNIVERSAL_QE=InputForm[True]
CHECK:universal_rayleigh_bounds:TRUE
CHECK:homotopy_endpoints:TRUE
CHECK:homotopy_determinant_polynomial:TRUE
CHECK:homotopy_strict_scalar_gap:TRUE
CHECK:positive_sqrt_product_bound:TRUE
CAS07_C02_FULL_SCOPE_CERTIFIED=TRUE
